<h1 data-copy-en="Ryia" data-copy-zh="Ryia">Ryia</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Huts recruitment, management advice, personal milestones and worker upgrades." data-copy-zh="茅屋招募、经营建议、个人节点与员工升级。">Huts recruitment, management advice, personal milestones and worker upgrades.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">在哪里找到</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系节点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">常见卡点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Training_Upgrade_Income_Bonus"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="NPC_Intimacy_Gallery_and_Completion"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Three_one-time_shared_resort_encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_with_Ryia"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sirena_Isle_Resort_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Three_Crafted_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Highest-point_replies_in_date_order"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Six_Optional_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Leave_a_Light_for_Me"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Morning_Without_Proof"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Unwritten_Line"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Without_the_Notebook"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="A_Page_of_Her_Own"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="One-Time_Heart-to-Heart_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Talk.2C_House_Advice_and_Encouragement"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Talk,_House_Advice_and_Encouragement"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recruit_Ryia"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Ryia — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/ryia.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Ryia — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/ryia.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Ryia — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Ryia’s route begins at the Peasant Huts and moves permanently to her room after recruitment. Her room conversations also explain house management, so return there when a new management option is unclear.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Schedule_and_Find_Her_Room"></span><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Before recruitment, visit the Peasant Huts 08:00–20:00. After recruitment, enter her room through Worker Quarters, 08:00–18:00. The move follows recruitment, including while she is off duty. The entrance appearance is 18:00–19:00 on days 3, 6, 9…; her Bar appearance is 19:00–20:00 on even days and needs a built Bar.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Place</th><th scope="col">Portrait hours</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Peasant Huts</th><td data-label="Portrait hours">08:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Condition">before recruitment</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ryia's Room</th><td data-label="Portrait hours">08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Condition">after recruitment</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Rose &amp; Thorn</th><td data-label="Portrait hours">18:00–19:00 days 3, 6, 9…</td><td data-label="Condition">after recruitment</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Bar</th><td data-label="Portrait hours">19:00–20:00 even days</td><td data-label="Condition">after recruitment</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Nine_Shared_History_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Five_Tutorials_and_the_Personal_Route_Order"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>At the huts, finish the opening event, the two newly offered story questions and A Page of Her Own. Complete the house operation choice, then use Invite Ryia to Join at the huts. There is no separate cash recruitment charge.</p><p>After moving, follow room → Elara’s Office → Worker Quarters → room. The five management introductions do not require waiting a full week. Then take A Small Indulgence, the early dates and each newly offered H2H; later invitations require their particular earlier conversations, not affection alone.</p><p>The late chain reaches Intimate (1600) for The Next Account Book, with Elara home rather than vacationing; Leave a Light for Me then needs In Love (3000), that event and Morning Without Proof. Event navigation below avoids retelling her past.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: personal and shared event navigation</summary><p>Each listed event happens once. Return to the named place after completing its prior steps. Completion affection is a base reward; dialogue choices can add further affection. The scenes and choice answers remain in the game.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base completion affection</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">When the Lights Were On</th><td data-label="Requirements">Peasant Huts; 08:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Ryia +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Putting It Into Practice</th><td data-label="Requirements">Ryia's Room</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Ryia +8; Elara +2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Reading the Report</th><td data-label="Requirements">Elara's Office; Putting It Into Practice</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Ryia +8; Elara +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Making Room to Grow</th><td data-label="Requirements">Worker Quarters; Reading the Report</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Ryia +8; Elara +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Trust Is a Working Stat</th><td data-label="Requirements">Ryia's Room; Making Room to Grow</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Ryia +10; Elara +2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Page Worth Keeping</th><td data-label="Requirements">Ryia's Room; Trust Is a Working Stat</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Ryia +15</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Request of Her Own</th><td data-label="Requirements">Sirena Isle Spa; 19:00–23:00; A Room to Perform; Cinnamon, Ryia recruited; Cinnamon, Ryia on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Cinnamon +3; Ryia +3</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Clothing_and_Other_House_Services"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Craft_the_required_gifts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_Visits_and_Eight_Training_Options"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><details><summary>Action costs, requirements and rewards</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / usable start time</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / normal limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Ryia</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Peasant Huts / Ryia's Room / Rose &amp; Thorn / The Bar</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+3 base affection; 6/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Story of the Name</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Peasant Huts; When the Lights Were On</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">0 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once; +8 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">What Happened to the House?</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Peasant Huts; A Rose and Its Thorn</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">0 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once; +8 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Invite Ryia to Join</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Peasant Huts; complete the house operation choice and A Page of Her Own; not yet recruited; Peasant Huts 08:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">0 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">recruits Ryia and opens her room; once; +8 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Page of Her Own</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Peasant Huts; The Cost of Glamour</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">45 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">dialogue-choice affection; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ask for House Advice</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Ryia's Room</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">0 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">management advice; no affection; repeatable</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Small Indulgence</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Ryia's Room; Acquaintance (50); A Page Worth Keeping; 09:00–16:00</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">45 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once; +20 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Without the Notebook</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Ryia's Room; Friend (100); A Small Indulgence</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">dialogue-choice affection; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Village Market Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Ryia's Room; Acquaintance (50); A Small Indulgence; 08:00–15:00</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $25; −30 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once; +8 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Farm Picnic Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Ryia's Room; Acquaintance (50); Village Market Date with Ryia; 16:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $30; −35 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once; +8 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Old Sign Walk</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Ryia's Room; Friend (100); Without the Notebook; 15:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −20 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once; +8 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Unwritten Line</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Ryia's Room; Close Friend (200); Without the Notebook</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">dialogue-choice affection; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Bazaar Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Ryia's Room; Close Friend (200); The Unwritten Line; 09:00–14:00</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $75; −35 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once; +8 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Moonlit Courtyard Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Ryia's Room; Crush (400); The Unwritten Line; 17:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; −35 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once; +8 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Choose Me, Just Because</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Ryia's Room; Crush (400); The Unwritten Line; 16:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; −30 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once; +80 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Morning Without Proof</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Ryia's Room; Romantic (800); Choose Me Without a Reason; 08:00–12:00</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">dialogue-choice affection; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Candlelit Supper Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Ryia's Room; Romantic (800); Choose Me Without a Reason; 16:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $100; −35 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once; +8 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Next Account Book</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Ryia's Room; Intimate (1600); Morning Without Proof; Elara not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">90 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once; +100 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Leave a Light for Me</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Ryia's Room; In Love (3000); The Next Account Book; Morning Without Proof; 16:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">90 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">dialogue-choice affection; once</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>Talk gives 3 base affection, up to 6 positive uses daily, and takes 15 minutes. Ask for House Advice takes no time and does not grant affection or train Communication. Worker visits, crafted upgrades, clothing and vacation activities use their own menus.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: permanent worker upgrades</summary><p>Each crafted upgrade doubles its matching training’s Experience and adds +50% worker income; the income bonuses add together. Each gift is consumed once. Ordinary training visits have their own costs and current work-shift requirements in the management guide.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Upgrade</th><th scope="col">Conditions / start time</th><th scope="col">Cost</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Woman in Her Own Story</th><td data-label="Conditions / start time">Ryia's Room; In Love (3000); The Next Account Book; Leave a Light for Me; Ryia home; 08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Cost">0 min; consumes 1 Abyssal Looking Glass</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No Footnote Needed</th><td data-label="Conditions / start time">Ryia's Room; In Love (3000); The Next Account Book; Leave a Light for Me; Ryia home; 08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Cost">0 min; consumes 1 Moonfang Leather Choker</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Pleasure Entirely Hers</th><td data-label="Conditions / start time">Ryia's Room; In Love (3000); The Next Account Book; Leave a Light for Me; Ryia home; 08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Cost">0 min; consumes 1 Hexbound Rose Sachet</td></tr></tbody></table><p><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Worker visits and training</a></p></details><details><summary>Optional reference: nine shared visits</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Host</th><th scope="col">Destination</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Ben Arthur</th><td data-label="Destination">Cobbler Shop</td><td data-label="Condition">host present; Ryia active and not vacationing; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Kent</th><td data-label="Destination">Traveler's Inn Tavern</td><td data-label="Condition">host present; Ryia active and not vacationing; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Fernando</th><td data-label="Destination">Tailor Shop</td><td data-label="Condition">host present; Ryia active and not vacationing; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Poppy</th><td data-label="Destination">Kitchen</td><td data-label="Condition">host present; Ryia active and not vacationing; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Lily</th><td data-label="Destination">Bards Guild</td><td data-label="Condition">host present; Ryia active and not vacationing; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Rose Arthur</th><td data-label="Destination">Crafts and Jewelry Stall</td><td data-label="Condition">host present; Ryia active and not vacationing; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Gastoff</th><td data-label="Destination">Blacksmith Shop</td><td data-label="Condition">host present; Ryia active and not vacationing; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Brandy</th><td data-label="Destination">The Bar</td><td data-label="Condition">host present; Ryia active and not vacationing; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sherry</th><td data-label="Destination">The Bar</td><td data-label="Condition">host present; Ryia active and not vacationing; once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Brandy’s visit can also start at the Rowdy Alehouse before her move. These visits have no forced order. Follow the host’s real portrait hours.</p></details><details><summary>Optional reference: three shared resort visits</summary><p>Assign Ryia and the companion active and on vacation together. Elara: Buffet 11:00–16:00. Sophie: Beach 08:00–17:00. Cinnamon: Spa 19:00–23:00, after Cinnamon’s room event. Each completes once and gives 3 base affection to each participant plus the chosen reply. Random portrait selection is not required for these automatic events.</p><p><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">Resort activities and Sea Shell rewards</a></p></details><details><summary>Optional reference: NPC intimacy gallery</summary><p>This character has three current gallery rewards at 100, 250 and 500 total NPC intimacy experience. Open the character details, then Intimacy details, and select an unlocked thumbnail. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience, worker Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate; viewing a reward adds no experience.</p></details><details><summary>Optional reference: affection bonuses</summary><p>Each favorite-stat threshold adds 1 before ordinary affection bonuses; the favorite skill doubles the adjusted base. Direct rewards remain the listed direct amount. An affinity is not itself a lesson offered by this character.</p><p>Intelligence 10; Communication 10; Charm 10</p><p>Favorite skill: Storytelling</p></details><p>Start windows exclude their ending hour. Costs are base values; applicable skills and active bonuses may change them. Base affection, direct affection, player experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate. Conversation choices can add rewards beyond event-completion affection.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><p>If the invitation is missing, check the huts conversations, their H2H and the operation choice. If she has moved, use her room rather than the huts. For The Next Account Book, bring Elara home from vacation. Worker relationship hearts and Loyalty do not replace ordinary affection requirements.</p><p>Date windows can be narrower than room hours: Moonlit Courtyard starts only 17:00–18:00. A history encounter needs Ryia active and home, plus the other host’s actual presence; the nine encounters are independent.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships and affection</a></li><li><a href="skills.html">Skills</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">Locations</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">House management and workers</a></li><li><a href="character-elara.html">Elara</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">Sirena Isle Resort</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Training_Upgrade_Income_Bonus"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-NPC_Intimacy_Gallery_and_Completion"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Three_one-time_shared_resort_encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_with_Ryia"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sirena_Isle_Resort_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Three_Crafted_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Highest-point_replies_in_date_order"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Six_Optional_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Leave_a_Light_for_Me"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Morning_Without_Proof"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Unwritten_Line"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Without_the_Notebook"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-A_Page_of_Her_Own"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-One-Time_Heart-to-Heart_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Talk.2C_House_Advice_and_Encouragement"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Talk,_House_Advice_and_Encouragement"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recruit_Ryia"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Ryia 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/ryia.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Ryia 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/ryia.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Ryia 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Ryia 的路线从农民小屋开始，招募后会永久搬到自己的房间。房间中的谈话也会讲解宅邸经营；不清楚新选项用途时，可以回去向她请教。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Schedule_and_Find_Her_Room"></span><h2>在哪里找到</h2><p>招募前请在 08:00–20:00 前往农民小屋；招募后通过员工宿舍进入她的房间，肖像时段为 08:00–18:00。即使暂时停工，她也不会搬回茅屋。入口处的出现时段为第 3、6、9……日 18:00–19:00；酒吧则是偶数日 19:00–20:00，且需已建成酒吧。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">肖像在场时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">农民小屋</th><td data-label="肖像在场时段">08:00–20:00</td><td data-label="条件">招募前</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ryia的房间</th><td data-label="肖像在场时段">08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">招募后</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">玫瑰与荆棘</th><td data-label="肖像在场时段">18:00–19:00 第 3、6、9……日</td><td data-label="条件">招募后</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">酒吧</th><td data-label="肖像在场时段">19:00–20:00 偶数日</td><td data-label="条件">招募后</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Nine_Shared_History_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Five_Tutorials_and_the_Personal_Route_Order"></span><h2>路线与关系节点</h2><p>在茅屋完成开场事件、随后出现的两项往事提问及指定谈心，再完成宅邸经营方式选择，便可从茅屋肖像发出加入邀请。招募没有额外金钱费用。</p><p>搬入后按房间 → Elara 的办公室 → 员工宿舍 → 房间的顺序推进。五项经营介绍不要求真的等待一整周。之后完成新出现的一次性行动、前期约会与谈心；后期邀请要求对应前置，单纯增加好感度不能跳过。</p><p>后期账目节点要求亲密（1600），且 Elara 未在度假。最终谈心则要求恋爱中（3000）、该账目事件及对应的早晨谈心。下方只列推进条件，不复述她的过去。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：个人与共同事件的触发条件</summary><p>下列事件均为一次性内容。完成前置后，请返回对应地点。完成好感度列为基础奖励，对话选择还可能追加好感度。剧情与选项答案请在游戏中体验。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">完成基础好感度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">灯火还亮着的时候</th><td data-label="条件">农民小屋; 08:00–20:00</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Ryia +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">把知识用起来</th><td data-label="条件">Ryia的房间</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Ryia +8; Elara +2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">读懂营业报告</th><td data-label="条件">Elara的办公室; 把知识用起来</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Ryia +8; Elara +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">为成长腾出空间</th><td data-label="条件">员工宿舍; 读懂营业报告</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Ryia +8; Elara +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">信任也是一项属性</th><td data-label="条件">Ryia的房间; 为成长腾出空间</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Ryia +10; Elara +2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">值得留下的一页</th><td data-label="条件">Ryia的房间; 信任也是一项属性</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Ryia +15</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">她自己的请求</th><td data-label="条件">塞壬岛水疗馆; 19:00–23:00; 一间属于她的表演室; Cinnamon, Ryia 已招募; Cinnamon, Ryia 正在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Cinnamon +3; Ryia +3</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Clothing_and_Other_House_Services"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Craft_the_required_gifts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Visits_and_Eight_Training_Options"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><details><summary>行动消耗、条件与奖励</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／可开始时间</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／常规次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">与Ryia交谈</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">农民小屋／Ryia的房间／玫瑰与荆棘／酒吧</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">15 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+3 基础好感度; 6次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">店名的故事</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">农民小屋; 灯火还亮着的时候</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">0 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性; +8 事件完成基础好感度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">这家店后来怎么了？</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">农民小屋; 玫瑰与它的荆棘</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">0 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性; +8 事件完成基础好感度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">邀请Ryia加入</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">农民小屋; 完成宅邸经营方式选择及属于她的一页；尚未招募；农民小屋 08:00–20:00</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">0 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">招募 Ryia 并开放她的房间；一次性; +8 事件完成基础好感度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">属于她的一页</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">农民小屋; 光鲜的代价</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">45 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">好感度由对话选择决定；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">请教经营</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Ryia的房间</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">0 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">经营建议；不增加好感度；可重复</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">小小的任性</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Ryia的房间; 相识 (50); 值得留下的一页; 09:00–16:00</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">45 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性; +20 事件完成基础好感度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不带笔记本</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Ryia的房间; 朋友 (100); 小小的任性</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">好感度由对话选择决定；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">村庄市场约会</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Ryia的房间; 相识 (50); 小小的任性; 08:00–15:00</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120 分钟; $25; −30 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性; +8 事件完成基础好感度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">农场野餐约会</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Ryia的房间; 相识 (50); 与Ryia的村庄市场约会; 16:00–18:00</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120 分钟; $30; −35 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性; +8 事件完成基础好感度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">旧招牌漫步</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Ryia的房间; 朋友 (100); 不带笔记本; 15:00–18:00</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟; −20 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性; +8 事件完成基础好感度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">未写下的那句话</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Ryia的房间; 亲密朋友 (200); 不带笔记本</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">好感度由对话选择决定；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">集市约会</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Ryia的房间; 亲密朋友 (200); 未写下的那句话; 09:00–14:00</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120 分钟; $75; −35 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性; +8 事件完成基础好感度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">月下庭院约会</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Ryia的房间; 迷恋 (400); 未写下的那句话; 17:00–18:00</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120 分钟; −35 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性; +8 事件完成基础好感度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">选择我，不需要理由</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Ryia的房间; 迷恋 (400); 未写下的那句话; 16:00–18:00</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120 分钟; −30 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性; +80 事件完成基础好感度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">无需证明的早晨</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Ryia的房间; 浪漫感 (800); 选择我，不需要理由; 08:00–12:00</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">好感度由对话选择决定；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">烛光晚餐约会</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Ryia的房间; 浪漫感 (800); 选择我，不需要理由; 16:00–18:00</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120 分钟; $100; −35 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性; +8 事件完成基础好感度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">下一本账簿</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Ryia的房间; 亲密 (1600); 无需证明的早晨; Elara 未在度假</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">90 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性; +100 事件完成基础好感度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">为我留一盏灯</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">Ryia的房间; 恋爱中 (3000); 下一本账簿; 无需证明的早晨; 16:00–18:00</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">90 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">好感度由对话选择决定；一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>交谈耗时 15 分钟，增加 3 基础好感度，每天有 6 次正面使用机会。经营建议不耗时间，也不增加好感度或沟通。员工探访、制作礼物升级、服装与度假活动使用各自的菜单。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：永久员工升级</summary><p>每项制作礼物升级使对应训练的经验翻倍，并增加 50% 员工收入；收入加成相加。各礼物只消耗一次。普通训练探访另有自己的消耗与工作时段条件，见经营指南。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">升级</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">自己故事里的她</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">Ryia的房间; 恋爱中 (3000); 下一本账簿; 为我留一盏灯；Ryia 未度假; 08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="消耗">0 分钟；消耗 1 深渊魔镜</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">无需脚注</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">Ryia的房间; 恋爱中 (3000); 下一本账簿; 为我留一盏灯；Ryia 未度假; 08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="消耗">0 分钟；消耗 1 月牙皮颈圈</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">全然属于她的欢愉</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">Ryia的房间; 恋爱中 (3000); 下一本账簿; 为我留一盏灯；Ryia 未度假; 08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="消耗">0 分钟；消耗 1 咒缚玫瑰香囊</td></tr></tbody></table><p><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">员工探访与训练</a></p></details><details><summary>可选查阅：九项共同探访</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">主持者</th><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Ben Arthur</th><td data-label="地点">鞋匠铺</td><td data-label="条件">主持者在场；Ryia 在职且未度假；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Kent</th><td data-label="地点">旅人旅店酒馆</td><td data-label="条件">主持者在场；Ryia 在职且未度假；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Fernando</th><td data-label="地点">裁缝店</td><td data-label="条件">主持者在场；Ryia 在职且未度假；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Poppy</th><td data-label="地点">厨房</td><td data-label="条件">主持者在场；Ryia 在职且未度假；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Lily</th><td data-label="地点">吟游诗人公会</td><td data-label="条件">主持者在场；Ryia 在职且未度假；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Rose Arthur</th><td data-label="地点">工艺品与珠宝摊</td><td data-label="条件">主持者在场；Ryia 在职且未度假；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Gastoff</th><td data-label="地点">铁匠铺</td><td data-label="条件">主持者在场；Ryia 在职且未度假；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Brandy</th><td data-label="地点">酒吧</td><td data-label="条件">主持者在场；Ryia 在职且未度假；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sherry</th><td data-label="地点">酒吧</td><td data-label="条件">主持者在场；Ryia 在职且未度假；一次性</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Brandy 的事件也可在她搬入前的喧闹酒馆触发。这些探访没有强制顺序，请配合主持者的实际肖像时段。</p></details><details><summary>可选查阅：三项共同度假探访</summary><p>需让 Ryia 与同行员工都处于在职且正在度假的状态。Elara：自助餐 11:00–16:00；Sophie：海滩 08:00–17:00；Cinnamon：水疗馆 19:00–23:00，且已完成 Cinnamon 的房间事件。各项只完成一次，给予每人 3 基础好感度，另加所选回复奖励；自动事件不要求抽中对应的随机肖像。</p><p><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">度假活动与海贝壳奖励</a></p></details><details><summary>可选查阅：NPC 亲密画廊</summary><p>该角色目前有三项画廊奖励，分别要求累计 NPC 亲密经验 100、250 与 500。打开角色详情，再进入亲密详情，点击已解锁缩略图查看。普通好感度、玩家情欲经验、员工经验与 NPC 亲密经验分别计算；查看奖励不会增加经验。</p></details><details><summary>可选查阅：好感度加成</summary><p>每达到一项偏好属性门槛，普通好感度计算的基础值增加 1；偏好技能会将调整后的基础值翻倍。直接奖励仍按标明的直接数值加入。偏好技能本身不代表该角色会教授它。</p><p>智力 10; 沟通 10; 魅力 10</p><p>偏好技能：讲故事</p></details><p>开始时段不包含结束整点。消耗为基础值，适用技能与当前加成可能改变实际数值。基础好感度、直接好感度、玩家经验与 NPC 亲密经验分别计算；对话选择可能在事件完成好感度之外追加奖励。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>常见卡点</h2><p>邀请未出现时，请检查茅屋谈话、指定谈心及经营方式选择。已经搬入后要去她的房间，不要继续在茅屋等待。后期账目节点还要求 Elara 结束度假。员工关系爱心与忠诚不能代替普通好感度。</p><p>约会窗口可能比房间日程更窄，月下庭院约会实际只能在 17:00–18:00 开始。共同往事事件要求 Ryia 在职且未在度假，并且另一位主持角色真正到场；九项事件彼此独立。</p></section>
